PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Input Reasoning Graph
    - Nodes representing reasoning states
    - Edges representing transitions
  L2: Discontinuity Highlight
    - Red jagged region indicating cognitive discontinuity
  L3: Stabilizer Operator
    - Large arrow labeled "𝒧"
    - 8px stroke, bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
  L4: Output Graph
    - Same graph but discontinuity region smoothed
    - Red region replaced with smooth curve
  L5: Labels
    - "Cognitive Load Stabilizer"
    - "𝒧(R) = R − discontinuity penalty"
  L6: Annotation Overlay
    - Text: "Stabilized reasoning trajectory"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
